id: transforming-weapon
name: Transforming Weapon
kind: crafting
slots: 1~2
# A Category of another Type for each Slot - two may share a Type, by the table's ruling.
chooses: otherTypeCategory
choosesPerSlot: true
alternates: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Categories of other Types, one for each Slot: an attack of that Type may be made with it as
  one.
# What it does, for the Effects on its Item's sheet: its Effects line as printed, word for
# word, cut into one line to an effect, each opening with its tag as the rulebook writes one.
summary: >
  [Passive]: For each Quality Slot this Weapon Quality takes up, select a Weapon Category of a
  different Weapon Type. You may use this Weapon as if it was a Weapon of that Weapon Category
  and Weapon Type. If you do, it has the same Weapon Size as this Weapon, but only benefits from
  other Weapon Qualities that are applicable to that Weapon Type.
text: >
  Transforming Weapon: This Weapon can be wielded as if it were another.
  –Weapon Type: All
  –Prerequisites: N/A
  –Quality Slots: 1~2
  –Effects: For each Quality Slot this Weapon Quality takes up, select a Weapon Category of a
  different Weapon Type. You may use this Weapon as if it was a Weapon of that Weapon Category
  and Weapon Type. If you do, it has the same Weapon Size as this Weapon, but only benefits from
  other Weapon Qualities that are applicable to that Weapon Type.

---

# Chosen attack by attack: an Attacking Maneuver of that Type offers it "as" that Category, with
# its Size, and only the Qualities that Type takes run.
